# Supabase Configuration
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url_here
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# Supabase Edge Functions (for deployment)
SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url_here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here

# Liveblocks Configuration
VITE_LIVEBLOCKS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_liveblocks_public_key_here
VITE_LIVEBLOCKS_HOST=https://api.liveblocks.io

# Application Configuration
VITE_APP_NAME=Scribes Quill
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0

# Liveblocks Webhook (for snapshot-note Edge Function)
# Replace with your actual Edge Function URL after deployment
VITE_LIVEBLOCKS_SNAPSHOT_WEBHOOK=https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/snapshot-note

---
# EMAIL CONFIGURATION IN SUPABASE DASHBOARD
#
# After creating your Supabase project, you MUST configure email settings:
#
# 1. Go to Project Settings → Email
# 2. Enable "Enable email confirmations"
# 3. Choose an email provider (Supabase Email Sandbox or custom SMTP)
# 4. For local development, use Supabase's built-in email service
# 5. Customize email templates (optional):
#    - Verification email template (default is used if not customized)
#    - Password reset email template (default is used if not customized)
#
# Important: Email confirmations must be enabled for security.
# New users will need to verify their email before accessing campaigns.
#
# To test locally:
# - Sign up with a real email address or use Supabase's sandbox emails
# - Check your email inbox for verification and reset links
